  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="9f267c0a-5506-4688-afc5-8a285b18a1fb"><problem><para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 4, solve each equation. Identify every correct answer.</para>
      <para>\(x(3x+12)=0\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(x=0\) and \(x=-12\)</para><para>\(x=0\) and \(x=-3\)</para><para>\(x = 4\) and \(x=-4\)</para><para>\(x=0\) and \(x=-4\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(x=0\) and \(x=-4\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(x = 0\) and \(x=-4\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
